          "value": "49.1 → 40.7 m",
          "desc": "默认相同扰动下，零指令与控制轨迹终点距靶",
          "html": "<b style=\"color:var(--jade-d);font-family:var(--mono)\">49.1 → 40.7 m</b>"
        },
        {
          "label": "难度",
          "value": "高",
